          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While an enemy unit is within 6&quot; of this unit, each time a Battle-shock or Leadership test is taken for that unit, subtract 1 from that test. While this unit is within 6&quot; of one or more friendly ^^**Adeptus Mechanicus Battleline^^** units, subtract 2 from that test instead.</characteristic>
