            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">This model must start the battle in Reserves. This model can be set up in the Reinforcements step of your second or third Movement phase, regardless of any mission rules. Any units embarked within this model can disembark after it has been set up on the battlefield, and if they do they must be set up more than 9&quot; away from all enemy models.</characteristic>
