        <profile name="Self-repair Mechanisms" id="4b04-cd5e-48b1-6343" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the start of your Command phase, this model regains up to D3 lost wounds.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Archmagos of the Xanan Dominion" id="b008-c01f-b3c4-37be" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the start of your Command phase, select one of the abilities below. Until the start of your next Command phase, this model has that ability.


^^**Rage of the Machine**^^: At the start of your Command phase, select one unit from your opponent’s army that this model can see. Until the start of your next Command phase, that enemy unit is your Machine Rage target. Each time a model in a friendly Adeptus Mechanicus unit makes a melee attack that targets your Machine Rage target, you can re roll the Hit roll and add 1 to Wound rolls. 


^^**Shroudpsalm (Aura)**^^: While a friendly Adeptus Mechanicus unit is within 6&quot; of this model, that unit has the Stealth ability.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
