          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the start of your movement phase, all models within 6” of this model gain the following until end of turn: This model can move over terrain features that are 4&quot; or less in height as if they were not there.</characteristic>
