        <profile name="Leader" id="a028-c00a-25f6-15fc" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">This model can be attached to the following units:
■ ^^**Castellax Battle-Automata Maniple^^**
■ ^^**Domitar Battle-Automata Maniple^^**

While attached to a unit, this model loses the INFANTRY keyword.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Arcuitor Battle Protocols" id="953d-2da4-183e-d3e9" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the start of the battle, if this model is leading a unit, that unit enters Arcuitor Protocols (see below). In your Command phase, if this model is leading a unit, you can select one protocol from those listed below for that unit to enter. Once a unit enters a protocol, it remains in that protocol until it enters a different one

- Shield Protocol: Add 1 to the Toughness characteristic of ^^**VEHICLE**^^ models in this unit.

- Wrath Protocol: Whenever a ^^**VEHICLE**^^ model in this unit makes an attack, add 1 to the wound roll.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Invulnerable Save" id="16a1-7a92-361c-f5f5" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">This model has a 4+ invulnerable save.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
