        <profile name="Invulnerable Save" id="c807-f114-edbc-c3c6" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">This model has a 4+ invulnerable save.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Abeyant Battlesmith" id="5b44-f8cf-87e6-3dae" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the end of your Command phase, select either one friendly ADEPTUS MECHANICUS VEHICLE unit within 3&quot; of this model, or this model, the selected unit regains up to D3 lost wounds. A unit can only benefit from this rule once per turn.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Cybernetic Pulse" id="87ba-36af-bd4b-89b6" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the start of the Fights phase, you can select one enemy unit within Engagement Range of this model’s unit and roll one D6: on a 4+, that enemy unit suffers D6 mortal wounds and, until the end of the phase, the Weapon Skill characteristic of melee weapons equipped by that enemy unit is worsened by 1. If the enemy unit is a VEHICLE, this ability instead triggers on a 3+ and deals D6+1 mortal wounds instead.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
