          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While this model is leading a unit, once per turn, when another model in that unit is destroyed by a ranged attack, after the attacking unit has finished making its attacks, roll one D6: on a 5+, return one destroyed model to that unit with one wound remaining and set it up wholly within 3&quot; of this model and not within Engagement Range of any enemy units.</characteristic>
