              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">From the second battle round onwards, when resolving the Fallout effect of the Rad-bombardment Detachment rule, if the bearer is on the battlefield, roll one D6 for each enemy unit within 6&quot; of your opponent’s deployment zone, in addition to those that are within your opponent’s deployment zone.</characteristic>
