              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">The bearer has a Leadership characteristic of 6+ and, once per battle, at the start of any phase, you can select one friendly CULT MECHANICUS unit that is Battle-shocked and within 12&quot; of the bearer. That unit is no longer Battle-shocked.</characteristic>
