                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the start of the Fight phase, select one enemy unit within Engagement Range of this model and roll one D6: on a 4+, until the end of the turn, reduce the Weapon Skill characteristic of melee weapons equipped by that enemy unit by 1.</characteristic>
