                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Once per battle, in your opponent&apos;s Charge phase, just after this model&apos;s unit has been selected as a target of an enemy unit&apos;s charge, this model can use this ability. If it does, until the end of the phase, subtract 2 from Charge rolls made for that enemy unit.</characteristic>
